{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-1","kind":"proposition","title":"黄金分割与线段平方关系","englishTitle":"If a straight line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, the square on the greater segment added to the half of the whole is five times the square on the half.","book":13,"number":1,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.1","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.1/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":1,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","contentId":"euclid-13-1","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e6de2d49c21b4ead2fa7b2b0e156f00db64a7e910463350fc370da8eca7fce36","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-1.statement","euclid-13-1.construction.1","euclid-13-1.construction.2","euclid-13-1.proof.1","euclid-13-1.proof.2","euclid-13-1.proof.3","euclid-13-1.proof.4","euclid-13-1.proof.5","euclid-13-1.proof.6","euclid-13-1.proof.7","euclid-13-1.proof.8","euclid-13-1.proof.9","euclid-13-1.proof.10","euclid-13-1.conclusion","euclid-13-1.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-1.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8fa4924794dc0325b797fde08fce2077ee56756d198cd1a17571ccac3099dfd3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, the square on the greater segment added to the half of the whole is five times the square on the half."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在黄金分割削减直线,则整个部分增加的较大数量部分的正方形是整个部分的正方形的5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23e1cb3f5642d6fc8787a73beda66b2db4514350a93d3fd0174edacb8d60d1bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the straight line AB be cut in extreme and mean ratio at the point C, and let AC be the greater segment; let the straight line AD be produced in a straight line with CA, and let AD be made half of AB; I say that the square on CD is five times the square on AD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将AB线的长度从黄金分割线削减到C点,将AC线的长度扩大为CA线,将AD线的长度扩大为CA线,将AB线的长度减半;我说,CD线的正方形是AD线的5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8a2a76ec3115167638f0dd6aad7f67f8433f4c53d849677af93a37146feacbc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the squares AE, DF be described on AB, DC, and let the figure in DF be drawn; let FC be carried through to G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AE AE DF 数字应用AB DC表示,DF 数字应用DF 数字表示;FC 数字应用G表示。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"07a30595d25ea4252334c17a6add1ab99971808330060fd7a9662c1fef071f82","citations":["euclid-6-def-3","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AB has been cut in extreme and mean ratio at C, therefore the rectangle AB, BC is equal to the square on AC. [[VI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-6-def-3), [VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,因为黄金分割的AB已经削减到C, 所以矩形,AB,BC等于AC的正方形。 [ [VI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-6-def-3) [VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1b62bdfbcb855ea026da3de84cb4a32e798255ab14cf54323af0696b96558c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And CE is the rectangle AB, BC, and FH the square on AC; therefore CE is equal to FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"CE是矩形 AB,BC,AC是FH,CE等于FH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f15139d19448ed383957e2337faaa891f378a461ec4fc5edece905f631dd7a6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BA is double of AD, while BA is equal to KA, and AD to AH, therefore KA is also double of AH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA是AD的两倍,BA等于KA,AD至AH,因此KA也是AH的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd94789993ca95e98f6de20ea42f97d69322b995d19b858bae215ca2fb4bef8c","citations":["euclid-6-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as KA is to AH, so is CK to CH; [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)] therefore CK is double of CH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,KA对AH的比等于CK对CH的比;因此,CK对CH的比是2倍；KA 与 AH 之比等于 CK 与 CH 之比。 [[VI. 1](/principles/euclid-6-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ca5e2aedcd1a222e3cfb70781234a610a86193fa2c1d5a73d205b73dec6a9dd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But LH, HC are also double of CH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但LH,HC也是CH的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6119ee95a03d91e796451b8cfd59ff415517f22354147fa9e099d647f99db5d5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore KC is equal to LH, HC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,KC等于LH,HC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c3ec933e8b6b414d12b6bbf43cee58d7103ea8497080045530f0283634b380f5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CE was also proved equal to HF; therefore the whole square AE is equal to the gnomon MNO."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CE美元也证明等于HF美元;因此,整个正方形 AE美元等于曲尺形 MNO美元。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8167eb10dfb8013000e28019b6cc2ca54ba674a641fd80fcc5795ddda1076cca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BA is double of AD, the square on BA is quadruple of the square on AD, that is, AE is quadruple of DH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA是AD的两倍, BA是正方形是AD的三倍, 也就是说,AE是DH的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e743e9e935c9a071c4758f77e0b6a24bf3e5934566807428b35fa714d65d881","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AE is equal to the gnomon MNO; therefore the gnomon MNO is also quadruple of AP; therefore the whole DF is five times AP."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AE等于曲尺形 MNO;因此,曲尺形 MNO也是AP的三倍;因此,整个DF是AP的5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b3106bb8e2d0fae8b9817e8f1222281d587feeef42088226776b64c7beec1d8d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DF is the square on DC, and AP the square on DA; therefore the square on CD is five times the square on DA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DF是DC的正方形,AP是DA的正方形,CD的正方形是DA的正方形的5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":13,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-1.source","contentId":"euclid-13-1","revisionId":"euclid-13-1@raw-e6de2d49c21b4ead","order":14,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7d21cbf3346be67a7440243230382b7c5616dde284b4a2d8bbd0d7378b0eadb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.1/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.1\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-1:euclid-6-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-1.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"VI. Def. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-1:euclid-6-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-1","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-1.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.1","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.1/","sourceLabel":"VI. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1